{"name": "Hacker News", "html": "<!doctype html>\n<!--\n  Hacker News — MyLLMos™ App Gallery · © 2026 Opticell Ltd\n  Source-available: read it, remix it, run your version inside MyLLM™.\n  Not for redistribution or republication. Terms: https://github.com/TeamDzX/myllm-assets/blob/main/LICENSE\n--><html><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\">\n<style>:root{--build-id:\"0b62e14fc8\";color-scheme:light dark;--accent:#ff6600}\n*{box-sizing:border-box}\nbody{font-family:-apple-system,system-ui,sans-serif;margin:0;padding:0;background:#f2f2f7;color:#111}\n@media(prefers-color-scheme:dark){body{background:#000;color:#eee}.head{background:rgba(20,20,22,.92)}.item{background:#1c1c1e}.tab{color:#888}}\n.head{position:sticky;top:0;background:rgba(242,242,247,.92);backdrop-filter:saturate(180%) blur(12px);padding:14px 16px 0;z-index:5}\nh1{font-size:20px;margin:0 0 8px}\n.tabs{display:flex;gap:4px;overflow-x:auto;padding-bottom:10px}\n.tab{flex:none;padding:7px 14px;border-radius:18px;background:none;color:#777;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;border:0;white-space:nowrap}\n.tab.on{background:var(--accent);color:#fff}\n.wrap{padding:6px 16px 24px}\n.item{background:#fff;border-radius:13px;padding:12px 14px;margin-bottom:9px;box-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,.07);display:flex;gap:11px;align-items:flex-start}\n.rank{font-size:15px;font-weight:700;color:var(--accent);opacity:.55;min-width:20px;text-align:right}\n.it-body{flex:1;min-width:0}\n.title{font-size:15.5px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.32}\n.title a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}\n.dom{font-size:12px;opacity:.5}\n.meta{font-size:12.5px;opacity:.7;margin-top:5px}\n.meta a{color:var(--accent);font-weight:600;text-decoration:none}\n#status{padding:16px;text-align:center;font-size:14px;opacity:.7}\n@media(min-width:768px){body{max-width:760px;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto}}\n</style></head><body>\n<div class=\"head\"><h1>🟠 Hacker News</h1><div class=\"tabs\" id=\"tabs\"></div></div>\n<div id=\"status\"></div>\n<div class=\"wrap\" id=\"wrap\"></div>\n<script>\nvar store=window.myllmStorage||{getItem:function(){return Promise.resolve(null)},setItem:function(){return Promise.resolve()}};\nvar FEEDS=[['Top','topstories'],['Best','beststories'],['New','newstories'],['Ask','askstories'],['Show','showstories']];\nvar active=0,cache={};\nfunction el(i){return document.getElementById(i)}\nfunction setStatus(t){var s=el('status');s.style.display=t?'block':'none';s.textContent=t||''}\nfunction api(p){return 'https://hacker-news.firebaseio.com/v0/'+p+'.json'}\nfunction ago(t){var s=Math.floor(Date.now()/1000)-t;if(s<3600)return Math.max(1,Math.round(s/60))+'m';if(s<86400)return Math.round(s/3600)+'h';return Math.round(s/86400)+'d'}\nfunction domain(u){try{return new URL(u).hostname.replace(/^www\\./,'')}catch(e){return''}}\n\nfunction renderTabs(){var T=el('tabs');T.innerHTML='';FEEDS.forEach(function(f,i){var b=document.createElement('button');b.className='tab'+(i===active?' on':'');b.textContent=f[0];b.onclick=function(){active=i;load()};T.appendChild(b)})}\n\nfunction load(){\n  renderTabs();el('wrap').innerHTML='';\n  var feed=FEEDS[active][1];\n  if(cache[feed]){render(cache[feed]);return}\n  if(!window.myllmFetch){setStatus('This app needs network access — enable it in Settings.');return}\n  setStatus('Loading stories…');\n  myllmFetch(api(feed)).then(function(r){\n    if(!r||!r.ok)throw new Error('HTTP '+((r&&r.status)||'?'));\n    var ids=JSON.parse(r.body).slice(0,24);\n    return Promise.all(ids.map(function(id){\n      return myllmFetch(api('item/'+id)).then(function(x){return x&&x.ok?JSON.parse(x.body):null}).catch(function(){return null});\n    }));\n  }).then(function(items){\n    items=items.filter(function(it){return it&&it.title});\n    cache[feed]=items;setStatus('');render(items);\n  }).catch(function(e){setStatus('Couldn’t load Hacker News: '+e.message)});\n}\n\nfunction render(items){\n  var W=el('wrap');W.innerHTML='';\n  items.forEach(function(it,i){\n    var url=it.url||('https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id='+it.id);\n    var dom=it.url?domain(it.url):'news.ycombinator.com';\n    var c=document.createElement('div');c.className='item';\n    c.innerHTML='<div class=\"rank\">'+(i+1)+'</div><div class=\"it-body\">'+\n      '<div class=\"title\"><a href=\"'+url+'\" target=\"_top\" rel=\"noopener\">'+esc(it.title)+'</a></div>'+\n      '<div class=\"dom\">'+esc(dom)+'</div>'+\n      '<div class=\"meta\">▲ '+(it.score||0)+' · by '+esc(it.by||'?')+' · '+ago(it.time)+' ago · '+\n        '<a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id='+it.id+'\" target=\"_top\" rel=\"noopener\">💬 '+(it.descendants||0)+'</a></div>'+\n      '</div>';\n    W.appendChild(c);\n  });\n}\nfunction esc(s){return String(s).replace(/&/g,'&amp;').replace(/</g,'&lt;').replace(/>/g,'&gt;').replace(/\"/g,'&quot;')}\nrenderTabs();load();\n</script></body></html>\n", "kind": "html", "iconSymbol": "newspaper.fill", "iconColor": "orange"}